    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anime Dream Match: Primates is a delightful and soothing memory game featuring captivating artwork of adorable anime primates . Test and enhance your memory skills by finding matching pairs of images to complete each level. As you progress, the game becomes more challenging and exciting, offering a truly enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a cute and calming world, perfect for relaxing and sharpening your memory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features of Anime Dream Match: Primates:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 50 engaging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Beautifully crafted anime art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Simple and intuitive controls (mouse)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Achievements to unlock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Relaxing and charming music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820830/extras/3b614ac0051236a4520d21004e2e6d08.poster.avif?t=1751698978\" width=110 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820830/extras/3b614ac0051236a4520d21004e2e6d08.webm?t=1751698978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820830/extras/071092e8f679274cf29b36c626f64d67.poster.avif?t=1751698978\" width=80 height=69 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820830/extras/071092e8f679274cf29b36c626f64d67.webm?t=1751698978\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 